==Event Information==
The Battle Cats has soared to a cool 88 MILLION downloads worldwide, and it's time to celebrate!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between February 19th (11:00am) and February 26th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6600|'''・Machines in Revolt'''}}<br>
Metal enemies attack the remnants of a destoyed city! Clear this stage to {{Color|#FF00FF|'''earn up to 10 Cat Tickets'''}}!<br>
Save the future from the onslaught of the coming machines!

※ After clearing a stage, there will be a short cooldown period before you are able to challenge the next stage.<br>
※ Spending a Catamin A will allow you to skip the stage cooldown period and challenge the next stage immediately.<br>
※ After clearing a stage, there will be a short cooldown period before you are able to challenge the next stage.

※ Spending a Catamin A will allow you to skip the stage cooldown period and challenge the next stage immediately.

※ If the event does not appear, please make sure that you are updated to the latest version of the Battle Cats app.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●Pick up piles of Cat Tickets during the TICKET FESTIVAL!'''}}<br>
Take on {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Cat Ticket Chance'''}}{{Color|#FF9900|''','''}} {{Color|#00CEFF|'''Siege of Hippoe'''}}, and {{Color|#34A853|'''Facing Danger'''}} by visiting the Stories of Legend/Event Stages in The Battle Cats!

{{Color|#46BDC6|'''● Cat Ticket Chance / Siege of Hippoe'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''11:00am ~ 1:59pm, 9:00pm ~ 11:59pm'''}}

{{Color|#FF9900|'''Facing Danger available to clear once each day! (Event resets at 12:00am)'''}}<br>
Load up on tickets and power up your forces to the MAX!<br>
※ Facing Danger can be cleared to receive rewards only once each day.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Builder's Blitz!'''}}<br>
Clear the stage to collect building materials needed for a better Cat Base! Visit Stories of Legend/Event Stages during the times below to put your Cat Army to the test in the special stages {{Color|#00CEFF|'''Cavern of Comets, Strait of Wings'''}}{{Color|#4285F4|''','''}} and {{Color|#00CEFF|'''Island of Ash!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''7:00am～8:59am / 12:00pm～1:59pm / 6:00pm～7:59pm / 10:00pm～11:59pm'''}}

Take on this challenge each day and stockpile building materials!<br>
※These stages will become available once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared.<br>
※ The Cavern of Comets, Strait of Wings, and Island of Ash stages will appear at regularly scheduled times in addition to the special campaign times listed above.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Cat Food presents every day!'''}}<br>
Visit the Battle Cats app to collect a reward of {{Color|#FF00FF|'''20 Cat Food'''}} each day of the campaign! Check in and profit!

